<title>SPAIN: Revised Spanish M4 figures for July.</title>
<headline>Revised Spanish M4 figures for July.</headline>
<dateline>MADRID 1996-09-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Bank of Spain, which earlier</p>
<p>released provisional M4 figures for August, subsequently</p>
<p>published revised data as follows:</p>
<p> MONEY SUPPLY		   AUG 96     JULY 96     AUG 95</p>
<p> M4 pct rise		     3.0	   2.9	   12.6</p>
<p> Domestic credit pct rise    7.1	   4.3	    5.3</p>
<p>Total money supply for August was 76.140 trillion pesetas unadjusted and 76.132 trillion if seasonally adjusted. NOTE - Latest month's data are provisional. Previous are both revised. Percentage monthly rises are on annualised basis.</p>
</text>
